<ecoSpold xmlns="http://www.EcoInvent.org/EcoSpold02">
  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="36a4aa25-9bbc-55a5-8265-9789358ccd6c" activityNameId="0fc37512-c36b-52b5-bf67-88461d2eb1cb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, aircraft, freight, long-haul, Betrieb</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, aircraft, freight, long-haul, Betrieb
Inventory refers to the entire transport life cycle. Airport infrastructure expenditures and environmental interventions are accounted for using the yearly transport performance at Zurich airport (478'800 tkm/a). Aircraft manufacturing is allocated based on the total life span of an aircraft (25'000 LTO), the average distance of a flight (7850km) and its average freight load (11.5t/unit);
UUID: 1ee537df-3efd-36ed-b0f9-c47f81cea60f
The dataset describes the operation of aircrafts including taxying, take-off and landing covering fuel consumption and operation emissions. Aircraft manufacture and maintenance, airport construction, operation and dismantling are inputs to this dataset
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Aircraft operation modelled based on passenger aircrafts operated by Lufthansa Group in 2019. The emission profiles distinguish between LTO and cruise.
Time period: Start date refers to emission factor data. End date refers to year of reporting fuel consumption and transport activities
Production volume: 7'866'000'000tkm
Sampling: fuel consumption is based on corporate data, emission profiles are based on FOEN statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1ee537df-3efd-36ed-b0f9-c47f81cea60f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
